{"id":"6f00f2970315d0916c75e3e2343aaf41fd7060e6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232034","title":"有没有发现， AI 的幻觉太严重了......","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"llfworker","excerpt":"程序员 - @llfworker - 最近做 vebo coding 开发，感觉 AI 模型的幻觉太重；有没有好用的 skills ？？？跪求高人推荐！！！！","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/幻觉\"><li></li> 幻觉</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a></P><p><span>17 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-05 10:17:11 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937088\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/51d35353d2ae93215a7ee9e7e20abe55?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skuuhui\" data-uid=\"687707\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skuuhui\">skuuhui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:22:29 +08:00\">22h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是这样子的，你先去找一些教程或者资料，看看。什么叫大模型幻觉，把很多基础搞明白了，自然自己就能解决很多问题，并且也有自己的见解</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937101\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a24d8830176cef46d6df4fde3465be5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zwyhzxy\" data-uid=\"209073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zwyhzxy\">zwyhzxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:24:12 +08:00\">22h 34m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>第一眼看我以为是微博 coding ，还查了下是什么新东西 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/xr1UOz1.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xr1UOz1.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937128\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 16:27:56 +08:00\">22h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个问题在 5 年前还有值得讨论的，现在是 2026 年 AI 已经会自己查文档自己检索文献了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937406\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f498/de4e/640447_normal.png?m=1785830961\" alt=\"William337\" data-uid=\"640447\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/William337\">William337</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:11:48 +08:00\">21h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>要有项目框架概念，做项目要有完整的 PRD,完整的计划-实现-测试-韵味交付流程才行，AI 有幻觉，要用外围的 agent 加以限制啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937432\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/70c6/14d6/217134_normal.png?m=1780563231\" alt=\"ybz\" data-uid=\"217134\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ybz\">ybz</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:15:18 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大部分幻觉来源于上下文不够</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937440\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6f7b/82ab/346271_normal.png?m=1740789816\" alt=\"zfyime\" data-uid=\"346271\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zfyime\">zfyime</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:16:06 +08:00\">21h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>早两年还有点幻觉 表现就是  常说一些文档没有的用法和方法给我<br>现在已经好了很多了 都会自己去查文档确认  不会虚构</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937461\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ce74/b141/12881_normal.png?m=1447684930\" alt=\"icyalala\" data-uid=\"12881\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icyalala\">icyalala</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:22:47 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没有发现，其实大部分人的幻觉比领先的 AI 幻觉还要严重</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937505\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5638/b0be/45568_normal.png?m=1410946106\" alt=\"loryyang\" data-uid=\"45568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loryyang\">loryyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:31:08 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你首先应该仔细看看，到底是不是幻觉。就像你不告诉我你的名字而让我猜你姓什么，这不叫幻觉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937565\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/85c5060a5396bcf62b4f4ddc58dc3d86?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yzw7489757\" data-uid=\"599265\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yzw7489757\">yzw7489757</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:42:36 +08:00\">21h 16m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>如果你用 AI 的姿势和写帖子描述姿势一样，那我基本能判断是你的问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937576\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dbd3/6c22/210254_normal.png?m=1715407255\" alt=\"8355\" data-uid=\"210254\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/8355\">8355</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:45:04 +08:00\">21h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>跪求高人推荐 应该是 20 年前的互联网用语了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17937586\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2f79/0900/562104_normal.png?m=1699595642\" alt=\"credo123\" data-uid=\"562104\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/credo123\">credo123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 17:46:22 +08:00\">21h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我天天在骂 KIMI 2.7 SB 。<br>KIMI3 用不起。。。用不起</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938492\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/27ab/664f/370726_normal.png?m=1654603301\" alt=\"StevenRCE0\" data-uid=\"370726\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/StevenRCE0\">StevenRCE0</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 04:30:31 +08:00\">10h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yzw7489757\">yzw7489757</a> 哈哈，点进来之前我以为 OP 另有高论。不过如果自己在做工程，面对纯 LLM API 甚至是直接推理结果，应该也有类似的感觉，就像在说服一位见多识广但是不再学习的老登为你做事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"AI 幻觉 模型17 replies • 2026-08-05 10:17:11 +08:00 1 skuuhui 22h 36m ago 是这样子的，你先去找一些教程或者资料，看看。什么叫大模型幻觉，把很多基础搞明白了，自然自己就能解决很多问题，并且也有自己的见解 2 zwyhzxy 22h 34m ago 1 第一眼看我以为是微博 coding ，还查了下是什么新东西 3 deplives 22h 30m ago 这个问题在 5 年前还有值得讨论的，现在是 2026 年 AI 已经会自己查文档自己检索文献了 8 William337 21h 46m ago 要有项目框架概念，做项目要有完整的 PRD,完整的计划-实现-测试-韵味交付流程才行，AI 有幻觉，要用外围的 agent 加以限制啊 9 ybz PRO 21h 43m ago 大部分幻觉来源于上下文不够 10 zfyime 21h 42m ago 早两年还有点幻觉 表现就是 常说一些文档没有的用法和方法给我现在已经好了很多了 都会自己去查文档确认 不会虚构 11 icyalala 21h 35m ago 有没有发现，其实大部分人